<title>CHINA: Japan Eximbank to extend $700 mln loan to China.</title>
<headline>Japan Eximbank to extend $700 mln loan to China.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Export-Import Bank of Japan will extend a $700 million untied loan to China, a Japanese Finance Ministry official said on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
